WEBVTT

00:00.960 --> 00:11.640
This sky is too brilliant, a new dawn has arrived.

00:17.980 --> 00:24.460
Even if I brandish what little courage I have,

00:24.560 --> 00:31.560
I won't understand the true meaning of strength.

00:32.390 --> 00:39.760
Let's climb up the gentle hill and become a star.

00:39.930 --> 00:43.070
If my wish comes true...

00:43.070 --> 00:49.820
My pain, my love, open up the door ahead...

00:49.820 --> 00:56.540
Just one drop of tears, faster than that one drop.

00:56.540 --> 01:06.050
I want to embrace you, therefore I will overcome my doubts in no time.

01:06.360 --> 01:13.080
This sky is too brilliant, the darkness will soon be gone.

01:13.370 --> 01:23.760
As the radiance hits the Prism, a new dawn has arrived.

01:44.840 --> 01:46.590
I've brought the drinks.

01:46.590 --> 01:48.340
Oh... I've been waiting for a long time.

01:49.510 --> 01:49.790
Yo!

01:53.390 --> 01:53.910
Damn...

01:55.490 --> 01:56.850
Who are you people?

01:58.440 --> 02:00.580
Quick, quick quick. Get out, get out, get out...

02:01.280 --> 02:02.600
Don't make so much noise.

02:02.920 --> 02:06.150
We're looking for the girl you were harassing.

02:06.150 --> 02:08.810
The blond, dumb looking princess with a bad attitude.

02:09.140 --> 02:11.280
You're the guy from before.

02:11.280 --> 02:13.450
You better spit it out quick...

02:13.450 --> 02:14.490
Or...

02:15.740 --> 02:18.110
Where is... Lady Priecia?

02:30.150 --> 02:31.920
Oh, Aruke...

02:32.590 --> 02:35.520
If we don't find Lady Priecia soon,

02:35.520 --> 02:38.580
Freeden will be destroyed. Destroyed.

02:43.290 --> 02:44.100
Cellima...

02:45.120 --> 02:47.490
How do you know my real name?

02:53.190 --> 02:56.440
The Knights Meet Again

02:57.950 --> 03:00.420
W-W-What did you say?!

03:00.690 --> 03:06.370
Lady Echo, you've been infiltrating
the Sablum Empire until yesterday?

03:06.370 --> 03:09.680
Yeah... I decided to go there while investigating a relic.

03:11.340 --> 03:13.250
It was very hot there.

03:13.250 --> 03:15.240
And thanks to that, my skin...

03:15.240 --> 03:17.960
Look, it burned...

03:19.060 --> 03:22.220
This is not the time to worry about your skin.

03:22.760 --> 03:25.730
That was too dangerous... Too daring.

03:25.730 --> 03:32.230
What country's royal member infiltrates their enemy's territory thinking, "Since I'm here..."?

03:32.550 --> 03:33.870
Don't worry.

03:34.790 --> 03:36.170
As not to cause any suspicion,

03:36.170 --> 03:39.280
I ingeniously put on a disguise when spying.

03:40.390 --> 03:43.660
But Gerot is so careless.

03:43.660 --> 03:46.290
I nearly assassinated him.

03:49.870 --> 03:54.100
Was there ever a royal member that acted so unreasonably?

03:54.100 --> 03:55.710
No, there wasn't. Full stop.

03:55.980 --> 03:57.940
It finally comes out, "hango".

03:57.940 --> 04:01.220
It feels like I've actually come home after hearing that.

04:02.670 --> 04:05.720
So far, there isn't any news of Meister or Queen Princea.

04:05.860 --> 04:09.630
Lady Echo, as their mother,
what if something happened to you?

04:09.630 --> 04:11.730
What would become of Windland?

04:13.150 --> 04:13.790
Lady Echo...

04:16.210 --> 04:17.770
Oh, a shooting star...

04:18.010 --> 04:20.590
How many years have passed since that incident?

04:21.800 --> 04:23.120
It's been sixteen years.

04:24.260 --> 04:26.530
How could we forget that?

04:26.900 --> 04:29.540
The night that Hyaweh fell from the sky.

04:29.680 --> 04:36.290
Meister and Queen Princea fell into Sablum's hands that same day, the Blue Moon Tragedy.

04:41.660 --> 04:46.900
I can't believe that it might be just
to save us from the threat of Angels.

04:46.900 --> 04:50.550
Thus, Hyaweh was sent down from the skies.

04:50.550 --> 04:54.480
And I don't want to voice such naïve thoughts,

04:54.480 --> 04:58.400
but it seems like something may be guiding all this.

04:58.400 --> 05:04.700
He coincidentally appears on the night of the Blue Moon Tragedy and raised on our side,

05:04.790 --> 05:09.120
then he happens to unseal power of
Ala-Gladius and slays an Angel.

05:11.270 --> 05:13.750
You're saying that all this seems predetermined?

05:14.060 --> 05:18.070
Yes. It has felt that way sometimes.

05:18.070 --> 05:22.300
Someone is manipulating this long lasting war on the Holy Land from the shadows.

05:22.300 --> 05:26.400
Using chaos to make this huge incident appear as a coincidence.

05:26.400 --> 05:30.470
All the while, plotting some great evil.

05:31.810 --> 05:34.100
You've finally noticed it as well.

05:34.500 --> 05:36.670
You too? That means...

05:37.990 --> 05:41.610
I wanted to confirm it, which is why I was traveling about.

05:42.050 --> 05:45.270
This last trip to Sablum was the final one.

05:51.170 --> 05:54.120
Hyaweh, cheer up.

05:54.120 --> 05:56.160
We've found Priecia.

05:57.710 --> 05:58.640
Really?

05:58.640 --> 06:02.670
Yeah, Bridget found a person who claims to have seen Priecia.

06:03.040 --> 06:05.170
So where's Priecia right now?

06:05.360 --> 06:07.780
In a church on the outskirts.

06:07.780 --> 06:09.100
Let's go there quickly.

06:09.100 --> 06:09.980
Y-Yeah...

06:10.710 --> 06:12.220
Shuban church?

06:12.500 --> 06:14.510
It was about three years ago...

06:15.260 --> 06:20.530
There was an incident where the Sablum Empire kidnapped a group of orphans.

06:20.530 --> 06:22.050
Do you remember?

06:22.050 --> 06:24.260
Yeah. I remember that.

06:25.090 --> 06:30.950
That's because it was a big incident in which Viella himself sent the Tempelritter out.

06:32.750 --> 06:37.540
<i>Listen well, proud knights who serve under me.</i>

06:37.670 --> 06:40.560
<i>The enemy claims to be with Lelihion,</i>

06:40.560 --> 06:45.050
<i>but the truth is, they are traitors who have sold their heart and soul to Aruke.</i>

06:45.330 --> 06:48.960
<i>Betraying your god is an unforgivable sin.</i>

06:48.960 --> 06:52.210
<i>In the name of Lelihion, execute the traitors.</i>

06:58.290 --> 07:02.120
The mastermind of the incident was said to be a Sister who works for the church.

07:02.120 --> 07:04.550
Theresa Tereide.

07:04.550 --> 07:05.610
Was said?

07:06.280 --> 07:11.100
Documents regarding the Shuban Church were confiscated and hidden by the Tempelritter.

07:12.010 --> 07:15.490
That's why, even now, the truth is still unknown.

07:15.660 --> 07:17.800
For the sake of those orphans,

07:17.800 --> 07:19.500
without any reward,

07:19.960 --> 07:23.750
and being a fully devoted Sister.

07:24.450 --> 07:26.750
Why did she suddenly betray her faith?

07:27.310 --> 07:30.080
Why betray the children who believed in her?

07:31.160 --> 07:36.010
I traveled to Sablum Empire to
investigate the truth of this incident.

07:36.010 --> 07:37.230
What...

07:37.230 --> 07:40.150
I thought it was the fastest way to find the answer.

07:41.090 --> 07:43.660
It was to get closer to Gerot, who kidnapped my daughter...

07:43.660 --> 07:50.780
and gave the huge power of the Angels to Sablum's army.

07:52.540 --> 07:53.800
In conclusion...

07:54.600 --> 07:57.490
Regarding this incident, Theresa is innocent.

07:57.490 --> 08:01.160
No, she was actually a victim.

08:02.090 --> 08:04.490
What do you mean by that?

08:04.490 --> 08:09.600
Saying that she kidnapped the children and took them to Sablum was a lie.

08:10.460 --> 08:14.660
The Sablum army wasn't engaged in that kind of activity.

08:14.660 --> 08:19.810
Then what were the Tempelritter's true intentions in Shuban Church that night?

08:27.560 --> 08:29.470
U-Um...

08:34.360 --> 08:37.110
I do not know what business you have here,

08:37.110 --> 08:38.320
but please leave.

08:39.110 --> 08:45.120
Because there is no god here that will listen to your prayers.

08:45.330 --> 08:47.940
That voice... It can't be...

08:47.940 --> 08:50.130
You're... still alive?!

08:53.120 --> 08:53.880
Priecia.

08:53.120 --> 08:53.880
Hyaweh.

08:55.090 --> 08:56.470
You had us worried.

08:55.090 --> 08:56.080
Why are you here?

08:56.100 --> 08:58.390
Have you fully recovered?

08:56.470 --> 08:58.390
What are you doing in a place like this?

09:00.270 --> 09:02.140
I'm sorry, Priecia. You first.

09:00.270 --> 09:01.890
Can't you let me speak first?!

09:08.960 --> 09:10.150
Those are...

09:10.390 --> 09:11.290
Instructor.

09:11.840 --> 09:12.650
Theresa.

09:13.390 --> 09:15.200
What's going on here.

09:15.200 --> 09:16.960
I have no idea.

09:18.650 --> 09:20.780
Although asking you this is useless,

09:20.780 --> 09:22.690
please put away your swords.

09:23.600 --> 09:27.170
I have no reason to fight you.

09:27.520 --> 09:28.700
Don't fool around.

09:28.700 --> 09:31.850
You might not have one, but I do.

09:39.400 --> 09:40.680
This...

09:45.050 --> 09:49.190
K-Karin... onee-chan...

09:49.600 --> 09:51.640
Wein, hold on.

09:51.640 --> 09:55.690
It hurts. My stomach is burning.

09:57.890 --> 09:59.570
Onee...chan...

10:01.920 --> 10:02.850
Wein!

10:02.850 --> 10:04.380
Find the instigator.

10:04.380 --> 10:05.460
Where's the Sister?

10:07.880 --> 10:09.040
Theresa.

10:23.190 --> 10:27.440
You will all have new fathers and mothers.

10:27.920 --> 10:29.140
Be thankful to God.

10:37.670 --> 10:39.760
She found it?

10:39.760 --> 10:44.100
No matter what happens, we still have a backup.

10:44.100 --> 10:47.000
We can't forgive anyone that gets in the way of our plan.

10:49.960 --> 10:52.750
Why? Why won't you beg for mercy?

10:53.340 --> 10:57.760
Do you think that if you don't resist, I will withdraw my sword?

10:58.100 --> 11:01.210
Regardless of whether you resist or not,

11:01.210 --> 11:03.760
I will kill you here, tonight.

11:04.200 --> 11:05.130
Be prepared.

11:06.490 --> 11:09.150
Kill me? That is impossible.

11:10.040 --> 11:15.850
That's because my life and faith
were both lost in the rain that night.

11:16.460 --> 11:20.320
You can't take away something that is already lost.

11:20.320 --> 11:22.280
Not even a god can.

11:33.620 --> 11:35.550
<i>I'm... hungry...</i>

11:47.740 --> 11:55.210
In the official announcement, Theresa and the children in the church were all executed that night by the Tempelritter.

11:56.150 --> 11:57.730
But the truth is,

11:57.850 --> 12:02.320
Theresa and some of the children weren't found.

12:02.540 --> 12:04.320
Then, they're still alive?

12:05.440 --> 12:08.080
All I can say is that they weren't captured.

12:08.360 --> 12:10.590
Whether they are alive or not, that's hard to say.

12:10.590 --> 12:14.540
A woman leading children without weapons or food...

12:14.540 --> 12:17.960
It's unthinkable that they were able
to escape from the Tempelritter.

12:19.140 --> 12:21.550
Karin, have you ever cried?

12:22.680 --> 12:25.390
Cried while eating?

12:25.760 --> 12:26.280
What?

12:27.640 --> 12:29.870
Renounce your beliefs.

12:29.870 --> 12:34.370
You, who foolishly swore your utmost loyalty to a god,

12:34.370 --> 12:38.150
will never understand the sorrow contained in these words.

12:38.640 --> 12:40.150
What are you talking about?

12:43.030 --> 12:48.710
To live means to seize everything that does not belong to you.

12:48.710 --> 12:53.410
You and me, not even God will be able to escape this fetter.

12:54.180 --> 12:58.400
That's why on that night, I abandoned my faith in God.

12:58.400 --> 13:01.400
No. I should say that I've seen through it.

13:01.400 --> 13:03.090
In order to kill God...

13:03.230 --> 13:05.760
How dare you speak blasphemy of God.

13:05.760 --> 13:07.140
I will not forgive you.

13:07.520 --> 13:09.920
I'll send you to hell.

13:09.920 --> 13:11.380
Mibu style, hidden sword technique!

13:11.380 --> 13:12.640
Souryuuzan!

13:11.380 --> 13:12.640
Twin Dragon Slash

13:16.100 --> 13:19.020
Letting you go to hell is far too lenient.

13:21.940 --> 13:22.720
Theresa...

13:31.340 --> 13:33.370
No! Priecia!

13:37.660 --> 13:38.250
Instructor.

13:58.010 --> 14:00.170
Theresa... That outfit...

14:02.000 --> 14:04.290
I will not forgive God,

14:04.290 --> 14:06.450
nor the believers.

14:08.000 --> 14:11.570
You evil entity. Have you sold your soul to a demon?

14:13.980 --> 14:15.800
Theresa!

14:17.270 --> 14:21.330
I'm Hell. The deathbringer who brings gods to the eternal hell.

14:21.330 --> 14:22.800
Sablum's Demon,

14:24.470 --> 14:27.740
Sister Hell.

14:36.070 --> 14:38.370
Punish... the god.

14:49.200 --> 14:49.940
<i>Is this the end?</i>

14:53.820 --> 14:54.740
You two...

14:54.740 --> 14:57.090
Killing an opponent who has lost their weapon...

14:57.090 --> 15:00.000
As a knight, I cannot forgive that.

15:02.990 --> 15:04.100
Ala-Gladius.

15:04.970 --> 15:06.910
So this is the boy that Cellima was talking about.

15:06.910 --> 15:08.760
The heir to Windland.

15:13.110 --> 15:14.130
Put away your sword.

15:14.130 --> 15:16.630
This battle is none of your concern.

15:17.650 --> 15:19.060
No, it is.

15:19.540 --> 15:20.660
What?

15:20.660 --> 15:25.040
I don't care how much hatred you have for her,

15:25.040 --> 15:28.010
or whether you believe in God or not.

15:28.010 --> 15:29.490
But until...

15:30.960 --> 15:33.760
I fulfill the promise to give you this,

15:33.760 --> 15:37.370
I will not allow anyone except me to defeat you.

15:37.690 --> 15:42.110
You are willing to die just to keep that promise?

15:42.110 --> 15:42.880
That's foolish.

15:46.780 --> 15:47.530
Priecia.

15:47.530 --> 15:49.140
Get back!

15:49.140 --> 15:51.380
This battle is for Weru,

15:51.380 --> 15:53.940
and for the children's pride.

16:06.740 --> 16:08.380
She has no openings.

16:08.380 --> 16:10.390
What to do? What should I do?

16:10.390 --> 16:12.340
The only way is by attacking.

16:12.340 --> 16:15.150
If there is even a slight mistake, it will be instantly fatal.

16:15.150 --> 16:17.450
She has to use an attack that is faster than her opponent's.

16:17.820 --> 16:21.130
Priecia, it's time. Release it now.

16:21.130 --> 16:23.210
Your final technique, Mirage Lash.

16:26.360 --> 16:28.760
<i>Can I do it?</i>

16:28.760 --> 16:32.510
<i>The Mirage Lash that makes three attacks with one strike.</i>

16:32.680 --> 16:34.400
Don't be afraid of failure.

16:34.400 --> 16:37.840
The present you, who is wielding the sword not for yourself but for others,

16:37.840 --> 16:39.020
is a true knight.

16:39.240 --> 16:41.020
Do your best, Priecia!

16:41.680 --> 16:44.160
<i>Weru, Aita, Mite...</i>

16:51.410 --> 16:52.980
You're stubborn.

17:01.160 --> 17:04.670
Mirage Lash!

17:23.900 --> 17:26.480
Why won't you execute the finishing blow?

17:27.070 --> 17:31.120
I don't know why you've abandoned your faith...

17:31.120 --> 17:35.330
or what you have done that made
you stay here to plant vegetables.

17:35.950 --> 17:39.860
But that way of repentance hurts Weru.

17:39.860 --> 17:43.180
And hurts those kids who believe in you with their heart.

17:43.180 --> 17:45.260
Do you really understand?

17:46.360 --> 17:48.670
The sorrow after being betrayed by someone you trust,

17:48.670 --> 17:50.880
you should know it the most.

17:55.370 --> 17:57.070
She's... crying.

17:59.240 --> 18:00.100
Accept it.

18:00.990 --> 18:03.370
With this cross hanging on your chest,

18:03.370 --> 18:05.310
face your sins.

18:05.310 --> 18:07.650
Have the courage to face your sins.

18:09.100 --> 18:10.150
Courage?

18:10.450 --> 18:16.080
Yes. The courage to face the harsh reality and your weakness without running away.

18:16.080 --> 18:19.700
That was what you and your tomatoes taught me.

18:27.950 --> 18:28.650
Who's there?

18:35.160 --> 18:36.720
You, come down here, now.

18:39.890 --> 18:40.600
What?

18:46.770 --> 18:48.770
Why would you do such a thing?

18:49.110 --> 18:51.270
Darkness Knight, why are you here?

18:51.850 --> 18:54.990
I heard that the kid who killed the Angel is here.

18:54.990 --> 18:59.280
I was hoping that if it is him,
he would be able to entertain me a little.

19:00.820 --> 19:01.310
Go away.

19:04.550 --> 19:06.470
Instructor! How dare you...

19:08.560 --> 19:09.610
So, you're the one.

19:13.920 --> 19:14.590
Damn!

19:15.070 --> 19:16.560
Come! What's wrong?

19:16.560 --> 19:18.230
The power to kill an Angel.

19:18.230 --> 19:19.950
Hurry up and let me see it.

19:19.950 --> 19:23.100
Power... Power... Power!

19:23.390 --> 19:25.030
What's with this sword.

19:25.030 --> 19:26.850
Open. Hurry up and open.

19:27.590 --> 19:29.280
How pitiful.

19:29.280 --> 19:32.400
You were merely being played around
by that uncontrollable power.

19:33.140 --> 19:34.400
You disappoint me, kid.

19:35.860 --> 19:37.420
Hyaweh.

19:46.800 --> 19:50.960
Stupid. Why did you help me, the one you hate so much?

19:52.270 --> 19:58.970
You came searching for me, even though I told you that I hate you, didn't you?

19:59.790 --> 20:00.970
Priecia.

20:01.530 --> 20:04.970
I'm a little happy.

20:07.390 --> 20:08.620
What is this feeling?

20:08.620 --> 20:12.190
It's like someone reached right inside my mind.

20:13.220 --> 20:16.490
That pocket watch. Who is that girl?

20:39.870 --> 20:41.630
Your... Majesty...

20:46.410 --> 20:47.230
Kizarov.

20:48.520 --> 20:51.680
Do not let Judas out off your sight.

20:52.080 --> 20:54.750
What's the meaning...

20:54.750 --> 20:55.960
See you...

20:57.780 --> 21:01.190
Judas, the commander of the Tempelritter.

21:07.230 --> 21:08.000
Good morning.

21:08.910 --> 21:11.700
Where's Theresa and Darkness Knight?

21:14.160 --> 21:16.960
That person said that she can't accept this yet,

21:18.820 --> 21:21.940
but she will take it from you one day.

21:21.940 --> 21:24.090
Until then, she wants you to hold it for her.

21:24.090 --> 21:25.450
She promised.

21:25.450 --> 21:27.390
Promise...

21:27.510 --> 21:31.070
I see. The promises that I must uphold...

21:31.070 --> 21:32.980
I have just gained another.

21:34.660 --> 21:40.060
Hey!! Hyaweh, Priecia!!

21:56.000 --> 22:02.230
When the star has fallen and the day becomes night,

22:02.610 --> 22:09.050
will the noise that I heard until yesterday disappear, too?

22:09.050 --> 22:15.840
In this brief moment of gentle wind, the sunlight shining through the trees

22:15.840 --> 22:22.530
gives me warmth in this dull scenery,

22:22.770 --> 22:29.620
so that I will still go on and reach that feeling!

22:30.120 --> 22:37.620
Even if I'm crying, even if I'm painfully wandering.

22:37.620 --> 22:43.550
I believe in your only radiance over there.

22:43.550 --> 22:50.820
Like the mists that shrouded the raining Earth,

22:51.130 --> 22:57.600
if all the meeting can be repeated on this planet,

22:57.850 --> 23:05.050
within this strange power, it will change into a miracle.

23:14.950 --> 23:17.910
Next Episode

23:16.140 --> 23:18.180
Finally there is peace.

23:18.180 --> 23:20.430
The young boy's and girl's hearts are in waver.

23:20.430 --> 23:23.620
Letting those two youngsters to be together forever, be it battle or fate...

23:24.100 --> 23:26.830
No, can it be anything but love?

23:26.830 --> 23:28.730
No. Definitely not! Full stop!

23:28.990 --> 23:31.470
It's now the confession of love on stage.

23:31.950 --> 23:33.800
Next episode, The Heart of Knights.

23:34.020 --> 23:36.250
Shine, everyone's prism!

23:34.600 --> 23:39.020
The Heart of Knights

23:36.250 --> 23:39.250
But the shiniest is, of course, mine!
